{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Dragonborn\n\nNote: This Feat is intended to use instead of the regular Dragon Fear feat.\n\nYou have awakened the inner natural power of dragons to inspire fear and, when angered, you radiate menace. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You learn the Fear spell. You can cast this spell without expending a spell slot using only it\u0027s verbal component. Once you cast the spell in this way, you can\u0027t do so again until you finish a short or long rest. You can also cast this spell using spell slots you have of the appropriate level. The spell\u0027s spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat.","level":1}],"id":"dragon_fear","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Dragon Fear [SM] [R]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}